  "question": {
    "text": "Match List I with List II<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>LIST-I<br />\t\t\tComplex</strong></td>\t\t\t<td colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>LIST-II<br />\t\t\tColour</strong></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">A.</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Mg</mi><mfenced><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mfenced><msub><mi>PO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">I.</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">brown</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">B.</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>Co</mi><msub><mfenced><msub><mi>NO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>6</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">II.</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">white</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">C.</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>MnO</mi><msub><mfenced><mi>OH</mi></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msub></math></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">III.</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">yellow</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">D.</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Fe</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><msub><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>Fe</mi><msub><mfenced><mi>CN</mi></mfenced><mn>6</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msub></math></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">IV.</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">blue</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below:</p>"
