  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The formula <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Mg</mi><mo>(</mo><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>)</mo><msub><mi>PO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math> represents magnesium ammonium phosphate it is white in colour.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>Co</mi><msub><mfenced><msub><mi>NO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>6</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is known as potassium hexanitritocobaltate(III). It is yellow in colour. The yellow colour is due to the presence of the cobalt ion (Co3+) in the complex, which absorbs certain wavelengths of light and reflects yellow light.&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>MnO</mi><msub><mfenced><mi>OH</mi></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msub></math>is brown in colour.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Fe</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><msub><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>Fe</mi><msub><mfenced><mi>CN</mi></mfenced><mn>6</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;is blue in colour.&nbsp;</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Complex</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Colour</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Mg</mi><mfenced><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mfenced><msub><mi>PO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">White&nbsp;</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>Co</mi><msub><mfenced><msub><mi>NO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>6</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Yellow</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>MnO</mi><msub><mfenced><mi>OH</mi></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msub></math></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Brown</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Fe</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><msub><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>Fe</mi><msub><mfenced><mi>CN</mi></mfenced><mn>6</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msub></math></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Blue</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table>"
